# Gas City / Beads — local software factory runtime state.
# Never tracked: bd writes machine-local values (dolt_server_host, an ephemeral
# dolt_server_port) into .beads/metadata.json, and .beads/dolt/ is a live
# database. Tracking these produces churn and leaks host config into the repo.
.gc/
.beads/
.dolt/
.beads-credential-key
*.db
